{{> menu active="about"}}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container has-text-centered">
    <h3 class="title has-text-white">Weather Reporting Made Easy - Release 4</h3>
    <div class="content has-text-light" style="max-width: 700px; margin: auto;">
      <p>
        Welcome to Weather Reporting Made Easy Release 4! This release focuses on giving users a better experience by:
      </p>
      <ul style="text-align: left; display: inline-block;">
        <li>Adding detailed time and date stamps to every weather report so you know exactly when each reading was taken</li>
        <li>Enabling members to view, edit and delete their personal details with full profile management</li>
        <li>Letting members create, list and delete multiple weather stations, with automatic cleanup of all related reports</li>
        <li>Providing full CRUD on reports—add, edit or delete individual readings, each stamped with an ISO date‑time</li>
        <li>Fetching live weather via Axios (with winddegree converted to N/NE/E etc.) and autogenerating reports with one click</li>
        <li>Showing trend charts (temperature, wind speed, pressure) over time for both dashboard and station pages</li>
        <li>Displaying stations as interactive map pins so you can see exactly where each lives</li>
        <li>Implementing robust errorhandling and validation on all routes and external API calls</li>
        <li>Persisting all data consistently in JSON via LowDB with a shared `initStore` helper</li>
        <li>Autologging in new users immediately upon signup</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

